<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bevcon raises half year earnings.</title>
<headline>Bevcon raises half year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>			 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     226.50	vs 202.09</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 85.22	 vs 74.84</p>
<p>    Equity-accted income  168.7	 vs 147.3</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  104.7	 vs 92.3</p>
<p>    Dividend income	 64.1	  vs 55.1</p>
<p>Div payable December 31</p>
<p>on register November 29</p>
<p>Full name: Beverage and Consumer Holdings Ltd (beverages, hotels and leisure)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
